                BSIK-AUGBL
                BSIK-AUGDT
                BSIK-GJAHR
*         changing
               INV_DATE                       " Date of invoice booking
               CURR_INV                              " Invoice currency
               RATE_INV       " Manually given exchange rate at invoice
               PAY_DATE                       " Date of payment booking
               CURR_PAY                              " Payment currency
               RATE_PAY.      " Manually given exchange rate at payment

*   Convert WT amounts into local curr. depending on spec. exchange date
    PERFORM CONVERT_INTO_LOC_CURR_OLD_WT.

*   Filling of data extract fields according to country specific
*   selection checks

*   Italy, Spain, Czechia, Colombia. Mexico
    IF P_VARIA EQ 'IT'
      OR P_VARIA EQ 'ES'
      OR P_VARIA EQ 'CZ'.
      PERFORM PREP_DATA_EXTR_OLD_WT_CTRGR_1 CHANGING PROCESSING_FLAG.
