*   Colombia, Mexico
    IF P_VARIA = 'CO' OR
       P_VARIA = 'MX'.
      PERFORM PREP_DATA_EXTR_OLD_WT_CTRGR_4 CHANGING PROCESSING_FLAG.
    ENDIF.

    IF PROCESSING_FLAG = 'X'.

*     Get CPD data from document
      PERFORM GET_CPD_DATA.

*     Convert amounts from local curr. into alternative local curr.
      IF NOT ALTCURR IS INITIAL.
        PERFORM CONVERT_INTO_ALT_LOC_CURR.
      ENDIF.

      EXTRACT DATEN.

    ENDIF.

  ENDIF.

*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
*               Country specific reports for listings                  *
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
END-OF-SELECTION.

  SORT.

  PERFORM GET_REPYEAR TABLES T_REPYEAR.

  CASE P_VARIA.

    WHEN 'IT'.                                         " Italy
      IF FORMULAR = 'X'.
        PERFORM MELDUNG_ITALIA.
      ENDIF.
      IF PROTOKOL EQ 'X'.
