*                   Performs several selection checks and fills        *
*                   the fields of the data extract.                    *
*                   The selection checks are specific for the          *
*                   country group (ctrgr).                             *
*                   Country group 3 is currently used for:             *
*                   BE                                                 *
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
*  -->  p1        text
*  <--  p2        text
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
FORM PREP_DATA_EXTR_OLD_WT_CTRGR_3 CHANGING P_PROCESSING_FLAG.

      CLEAR P_PROCESSING_FLAG.

*      if p_varia eq 'BE'.
        CHECK BSIK-UMSKS NE 'A'.
*      endif.
      CASE BSIK-UMSKS.
        WHEN ' '.
*          if p_varia ne 'BE'.
*            check augdat.
*          else.
            CHECK BUCHDT.
*          endif.
          CHECK BSIK-XZAHL NE 'X'.
          CHECK BSIK-BSCHL IN BUSCHL.
          CHECK BELNUM.
          IF UNAUSGEG NE 'X'.
